    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3826" root="ترب" body-key="t">
    
      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تترّب</span></b>  <i>He,</i> (T,) or <i>it,</i> (S,) <i>became defiled,</i> or
<i>soiled,</i> (T, S,) <i>in the dust,</i> or <i>earth,</i> (T,) or <i>with
dust,</i> or <i>earth:</i> (S:) <i>it had dust,</i> or <i>earth, sticking
to it.</i> (M.)

